      "compression_ratio": 1.315789,
      "end": 5924.04,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5919.44,
      "text": "跟你共产党海航,刘成杰,冠军的爹是谁?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.143929,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315789,
      "end": 5927.64,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5924.04,
      "text": "是不是啊?孙瑶玩大熊猫有毛关系吗?对不对啊?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.143929,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315789,
      "end": 5932.5,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5927.88,
      "text": "跟你共产党新疆大屠杀,香港大屠杀有啥关系吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.143929,
      "compression_ratio": 1.315789,
      "end": 5935.32,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5932.5,
      "text": "和中国人活在水深火热之中有啥关系吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5939.68,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5935.32,
      "text": "郭骗子。那都五年过去了,我骗过谁呢?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5941.72,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5939.68,
      "text": "骗过谁一分钱了呢?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5943.76,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5941.72,
      "text": "是跟谁上过床?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5945.82,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5943.76,
      "text": "还是骗过你一分钱?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5951.2,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5945.82,
      "text": "还有,他就没有一个人说出来,1120那个黄河边。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5954.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5951.2,
      "text": "只要郭文贵能开成这个会,我致死。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5958.62,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5954.0,
      "text": "这样的事情,你知道欺民贼说过多少遍了?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.21367,
      "compression_ratio": 1.29588,
      "end": 5964.76,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5958.62,
      "text": "管一个熊献民推特上上签字说,郭文贵明天就被抓了?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5967.88,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5965.32,
      "text": "马上睡马路了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5972.48,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5967.88,
      "text": "你想过吗?亨利小哥,马上睡马路了,又开飞机淘宝了,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5974.8,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5972.48,
      "text": "没办事了,这关系又输了。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5976.08,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5974.8,
      "text": "是吧?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5980.94,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5976.08,
      "text": "熊献民要不是特务,我负一切法律责任。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5987.84,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5980.94,
      "text": "吴征、吴斌、博讯、韦什不是特务,我负一切责任。"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.275071,
      "compression_ratio": 1.307339,
      "end": 5992.96,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5987.84,
      "text": "你见过一个人跟他数不相识,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.412844,
      "end": 5997.56,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5992.96,
      "text": "就攻击他三五年天天希望他被抓被杀死掉的人,"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.412844,
      "end": 5999.62,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5997.56,
      "text": "你觉得他会没原因吗?"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.220563,
      "compression_ratio": 1.412844,
      "end": 6004.48,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5999.62,
      "text": "他只有一个原因,一个为了利益,一个为了私仇,"
